nagement#查看服务状态","content":"查看状态时不能只确认容器存在，还要检查是否持续重启、端口是否映射、启动时间是否异常。容器刚启动成功但应用仍在初始化时，浏览器可能暂时无法访问，需要结合日志判断。"},"3413":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"v1.5.10 单机部署中，`crest` 是前端 Nginx 网关，`crest-service` 是后端 Spring Boot 服务。页面无法访问时优先查看 `crest`；登录、接口、数据集、导出和权限异常时优先查看 `crest-service`。启用监控后，Prometheus 和 Grafana 日志分别查看："},"3414":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"排查启动失败时，优先关注："},"3415":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"关键字"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"可能原因"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`Flyway`"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"数据库迁移失败"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`Access denied`"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"数据库账号或密码错误"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`Connection refused`"},"3422":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"数据库地址、端口或网络异常"},"3423":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`OutOfMemory`"},"3424":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"内存不足"},"3425":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`permission denied`"},"3426":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"目录权限异常"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"日志排查建议按时间点进行。用户反馈“10:30 打不开仪表盘”时，优先查看 10:25 到 10:35 的日志，再结合审计日志和浏览器报错。不建议直接从最新日志向前翻查，容易遗漏关键异常。"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"修改配置后通常需要重启："},"3429":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"重启后检查："},"3430":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"容器是否运行。"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"登录页是否可访问。"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"管理员是否能登录。"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"工作台和系统设置是否正常打开。"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"工作台能打开，说明前端资源、后端接口和基础元数据读取基本正常。继续打开数据源、数据集、仪表盘和导出中心，才能确认业务链路恢复。"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"如果重启后页面能打开但图表空白，继续检查数据源连接、数据库连接池、后端日志和浏览器网络请求。服务重启成功只是第一步，不能证明业务链路已经完整恢复。"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"备份文件可能包含数据库内容、上传文件、导出文件和业务配置，应按敏感数据管理。"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"执行恢复前，应先确认恢复目标、备份时间和影响范围。恢复完成后，必须验证登录、权限、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出，而不是只看命令执行成功。"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"恢复后打开导出中心，确认历史任务状态和新导出任务都正常。导出文件涉及运行目录和文件权限，是恢复检查中容易遗漏的一环。"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#停机窗口","content":"升级、迁移数据库、恢复备份和调整密钥前，应安排停机窗口。停机窗口内建议禁止用户继续创建资源、导出文件或修改权限，避免状态不一致。"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"page","content":"单机在线安装","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","安装部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","content":"使用 installer/install.sh 在线安装 Crest，并理解关键配置和安装结果。"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#安装目录","content":"安装目录"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#修改安装配置","content":"修改安装配置"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#执行安装","content":"执行安装"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#读取配置","content":"读取配置"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-5","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#初始化目录","content":"初始化目录"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-6","page_id"