ontent":"资源是否被移动、删除或取消发布。"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"搜索关键字和资源类型筛选是否过窄。"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"用普通测试账号复现，确认不是管理员视角误判。"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"角色管理页用于维护用户职责分类。建议把角色按职责设计，而不是按个人设计。例如数据管理员、内容编辑者、业务查看者、安全审计员。后续人员变动时，只需调整用户归属，不需要重做权限模型。"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"这通常是功能权限或资源操作权限不足。处理方法："},"3879":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认该用户是否具备资源编辑职责。"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查角色是否有编辑功能权限。"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查资源是否授权编辑而不只是查看。"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认资源是否被其他用户锁定或正在编辑。"},"3883":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"使用普通测试账号验证按钮是否出现。"},"3884":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"v1.5.6 起，只读可见资源不会展示复制、移动、重命名和删除等管理入口。若用户需要复制或维护仪表盘、大屏，应授予资源管理权限，而不是只授予查看权限。"},"3885":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"公开分享链接属于只读访问链路。当前版本中，即使用户已经登录后台，访问 `/link/:uuid` 也会按分享页策略打开；后台工作台、数据源、数据集等管理路径仍按菜单权限和功能权限校验。排查权限问题时，不要把分享页能访问误判为后台资源权限已开放。"},"3886":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"管理员权限应按职责拆分，不建议所有管理员都拥有完整系统管理权限。"},"3887":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"建议拆分："},"3888":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"角色"},"3889":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"权限"},"3890":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"平台管理员"},"3891":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"用户、角色、系统参数、审计"},"3892":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"数据管理员"},"3893":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"数据源、数据集、缓存同步"},"3894":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"内容管理员"},"3895":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出"},"3896":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"安全管理员"},"3897":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-64","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"权限复核、审计、SSO"},"3898":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-65","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"禁用账号。"},"3899":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-66","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"回收角色。"},"3900":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-67","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"检查其创建的分享链接。"},"3901":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-68","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"检查其负责的数据源、数据集、仪表盘和大屏。"},"3902":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-69","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"将关键资源移交给新负责人。"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-70","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"在审计日志中保留处理记录。"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-71","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#离职账号如何处理","content":"用户管理页用于确认账号状态、归属组织、角色和基础信息。离职、转岗、临时外包和 SSO 自动创建用户，都应该先在这里确认账号是否仍然有效。"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-72","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#权限修改后用户仍然看不到","content":"可能原因："},"39