shboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"保留 1 到 2 位小数"},"5071":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"毛利率"},"5072":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"`gross_margin_rate`"},"5073":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"平均"},"5074":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"百分比"},"5075":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"创建时先添加一张指标卡，配置好标题、单位和字号后复制三份，再分别替换指标字段。这样能保证四张卡的样式一致。"},"5076":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"指标卡验收时，不只看数字是否出现，还要确认标题是否包含范围。例如“销售额”不如“本月销售额”清楚；“完成率”不如“本月需求完成率”清楚。"},"5077":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"可按以下步骤操作："},"5078":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加第一张指标卡","content":"从图表面板选择指标卡，放到页面第一行左侧。选择经营数据集，把“销售额”或自己的核心指标拖到指标位置。"},"5079":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置标题和单位","content":"标题写成“本月销售额”或“本月交付需求数”。金额统一万元或元，数量统一整数。"},"5080":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#复制组件","content":"复制三份指标卡，横向排列，保持相同高度和间距。"},"5081":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#替换字段","content":"分别把指标换成订单数、客单价、毛利率，或替换成需求数、完成率、平均周期、风险数。"},"5082":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览核对","content":"保存并预览，确认筛选条件改变后四张指标卡都同步变化。"},"5083":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图回答“最近是否变好”。示例配置如下："},"5084":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置项"},"5085":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"5086":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"图表类型"},"5087":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"折线图"},"5088":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"X 轴"},"5089":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"日期"},"5090":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"Y 轴"},"5091":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"销售额、订单数"},"5092":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"排序"},"5093":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"日期升序"},"5094":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"过滤"},"5095":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"最近 30 天或本月"},"5096":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-276","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置完成后检查两件事：日期是否连续，指标单位是否一致。如果销售额和订单数差异很大，建议拆成两张图，或者使用双轴图并明确左右轴单位。"},"5097":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图建议保留横轴日期和悬浮提示。标签过密时不宜全部显示，否则页面可读性会下降。业务汇报中，趋势图标题要写清统计周期，例如“近 30 天销售额趋势”。"},"5098":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置趋势图时，日期字段是常见出错点。日期如果被识别成文本，就会按字符串排序，`2026-10` 可能排在 `2026-2` 前面。遇到这种情况，回到数据集把字段类型改成日期，或者在 SQL 中转换日期。"},"5099":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"排行图用于定位贡献最高或风险最高的对象；明细表用于进一步追溯。"},"5100":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"图表"},"5101":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"5102":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"配置重点"},"5103":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"区域销售排行"},"5104":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-284","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"区域 + 销售额"},"5105":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-285","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"销售额降序，限制 Top 10"},"5106":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-286","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店销售排行"},"5107":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-287","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店 + 销售额"},"5108":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店名称长时用条形图"},"5109":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"渠道结构"},"5110":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"渠道 + 销售额"},"5111":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"分类不超过 6 个"},"5112":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店明细表"},"5113":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店、区域、销售额、订单数、毛利率"},"5114":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"列宽、排序、导出权限"},"5115":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格不宜放置过多列。正式页面中，表格的价值是追溯问题，而不是把数据库整张表搬进仪表盘。"},"5116":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"明细表放在页面底部更合适。用户先看指标和趋势，发现异常后再下拉查看明细。表格如果允许导出，发布前要确认列权限和导出权限。"},"5117":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格建议只保留能帮助定位问题的列。例如经营页面保留区域、门店、负责人、销售额、订单数、毛利率；项目页面保留项目、需求编号、阶段、负责人、在库天数、优先级。不应把数据库中的所有字段都放进表格。"},"5118":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第五步添加查询组件","content":"顶部查询组件建议先做日期和业务范围："},"5119":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加日期筛选","content":"放在页面顶部，默认值可以设置为本月或最近 30 天。"},"5120":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加区域筛选","content":"使用下拉或搜索组件，绑定区域字段。"},"5121":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#绑定目标图表-1","content":"日期筛选通常绑定全部图表；区域筛选绑定趋势图、排行图和明细表。"},"5122":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"保存后进入预览，切换日期和区域，确认所有目标图表都同步变化。"},"5123":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"如果多个图表来自不同数据集，字段名称可以不同，但业务含义必须一致。例如一个数据集叫“区域”，另一个叫“销售大区”，只要口径一致就可以映射。"},"5124":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"查询组件验收可按固定步骤执行：保存后进入预览，先记录一个指标卡数值，再切换筛选条件。如果目标图表没有变化，回到编辑器检查目标组件、筛选字段和默认值。"},"5125":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"这张图可对照“添加筛选器”的入口。日期、下拉、文本搜索、数字区间都属于查询组件。添加后必须绑定目标图表和字段；如果只把组件放到页面上，用户点击它不会影响任何图表。"},"5126":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"示例：日期筛选绑定所有图表的“日期”字段，区域筛选绑定所有图表的“区域”字段。若某张图来自另一个数据集，也要为它单独映射字段。"},"5127":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest