-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"先只拖主表，预览行数和指标合计。"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-191","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"加入关联表后再次预览。"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-192","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"对比核心指标是否被放大或明显变小。"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-193","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"如果指标被放大，优先检查关联字段是否唯一。一对多关联是常见原因。"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-194","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"多表建模操作顺序："},"5436":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-195","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#先拖主表","content":"主表代表分析粒度，例如订单、工单、需求或流水。先只用主表预览一次，记录行数和核心指标合计。"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-196","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#再拖关联表","content":"关联表只补充属性，例如组织、门店、项目、客户。不应将两张事实表直接随意关联。"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-197","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#配置关联字段","content":"选择两边含义一致的字段，例如 `store_id` 对 `store_id`、`project_id` 对 `project_id`。"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-198","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择关联方式","content":"保留主表全部记录时用左关联；只保留两边都匹配的数据时用内关联。首次配置优先从左关联开始。"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-199","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#对比预览结果","content":"加关联表后再次预览。如果核心指标突然变大，通常是维表不唯一