taset#分组字段","content":"分组字段保存后，要在预览里检查每个分组是否有数据，尤其是“其他”分组是否异常偏大。"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"数据集保存后，不建议直接交给用户使用。应先完成一次完整检查。"},"5494":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"保存后检查清单："},"5495":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"数据预览能正常返回。"},"5496":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"字段结构清晰，维度和指标分类正确。"},"5497":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"关键指标抽样核对过。"},"5498":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"字段名称没有数据库缩写。"},"5499":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"计算字段和分组字段能返回正确结果。"},"5500":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"权限范围符合使用对象。"},"5501":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"如果开启缓存，同步时间和业务刷新频率一致。"},"5502":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"源表字段变化后，数据集可能需要同步。常见变化包括新增字段、删除字段、字段改名、字段类型变化。同步后要检查下游图表是否仍能正常显示。"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"数据集中已经被图表使用的字段，不应直接删除或改名。先查下游资源，再与页面负责人确认替代字段。"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"默认情况下，数据集可以采用直连方式读取源库。直连适合数据量较小、查询压力可控、源库稳定的场景。对于查询较重、源库不适合频繁访问，或需要固定刷新窗口的数据集，可以启用缓存，让 Crest 先把数据同步到缓存表，再由图表读取缓存结果。"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"当前版本中，MySQL 数据源支持数据集缓存。基于 MySQL 创建的数据集可选择直连读取或缓存读取；仪表盘和数据大屏通过该数据集取数时，也可读取缓存结果。"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存设置位于数据集编辑器左侧。图中“直连/缓存”决定查询路径，“增量/全量”决定每次更新的范围，“手动/定时”决定更新触发方式。设置完成后不能只保存，还要点击“立即更新”或等待定时任务执行，并检查状态。"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"这张图要按从上到下的顺序看：先决定直连还是缓存，再决定全量还是增量，最后决定手动还是定时。只设置“定时”但未完成首次同步时，仪表盘仍然无法读取缓存数据。"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"当前版本的缓存能力面向 MySQL 数据源数据集。看不到“缓存”选项时，先确认数据源类型、部署版本、系统配置和当前账号权限。"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存区域常用配置如下："},"5510":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"配置项"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"说明"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"建议"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"读取方式"},"5514":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"选择直连或缓存"},"5515":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"源库压力大、图表打开慢时优先评估缓存"},"5516":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"更新方式"},"5517":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-276","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"全量或增量"},"5518":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"小表、维表用全量；大表、有递增字段时用增量"},"5519":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"更新频率"},"5520":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"手动或定时"},"5521":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"临时数据用手动；正式看板按业务刷新节奏配置定时"},"5522":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"增量字段"},"5523":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"判断新增数据的水位字段"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"优先选择自增 ID、更新时间、业务流水时间"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-284","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"立即更新"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-285","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"手动提交一次同步任务"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-286","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"新建或改字段后先执行一次"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-287","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存状态"},"5529":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"展示最近执行状态、缓存可用状态、源数据行数、缓存行数和一致性校验结果"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"发布页面前必须确认缓存可用且校验结果符合预期"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"全量更新会重新拉取数据集范围内的数据。它适合数据量不大、字段结构经常变化，或没有可靠增量字段的数据集。"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#全量更新","content":"操作步骤："},"5533":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#打开数据集编辑器","content":"进入“数据准备 → 数据集”，选择目标数据集并进入编辑。"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#切换为缓存读取","content":"在左侧配置区把“读取方式”选为“缓存”。如果页面没有该选项，说明当前数据集或数据源不支持缓存。"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择全量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“全量”。全量方式不需要增量字段。"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置更新频率","content":"需要人工控制时选“手动”；需要固定刷新时选“定时”，再设置分钟、小时或天级间隔。"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”，等待状态变为可用。然后切到数据预览，抽查行数、日期范围和核心指标。"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"全量更新配置简单，但数据量越大，执行时间和源库压力越高。正式环境建议避开业务高峰，例如设置在凌晨或数据仓库批处理完成之后。"},"5539":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#立即更新并验收","content":"点击“立即更新”时，系统会先保存当前数据集和缓存配置，再提交同步任务。修改字段、过滤条件、更新方式或定时配置后，不需要先单独保存一次再更新，但仍应在任务结束后检查预览结果。"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新只拉取水位字段之后的新数据，并定期做全量校准。它适合订单、日志、需求流转、工单、流水等持续增长的数据。"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置用于控制缓存任务的稳定性。增量字段决定同步起点；全量刷新间隔用于定期校准缓存；超时时间防止任务长期挂起；更新后校验用于发现源端和缓存端差异。"},"5542":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"高级设置不应随意跳过。增量字段选错时，常见问题不是任务失败，而是产生隐性漏数。比如需求状态会回写历史记录，只用创建时间做增量，就可能漏掉历史需求的状态变化；这种场景更适合用更新时间作为水位字段。"},"5543":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"切换增量字段或更新方式时，系统会清理旧水位。下一次同步会按新配置重新计算水位，不会继续沿用旧字段的同步位置。变更前建议记录原字段、变更原因和首次同步结果，方便回溯。"},"5544":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量更新要先选对水位字段。常见选择如下："},"5545":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"字段类型"},"5546":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"是否推荐"},"5547":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"说明"},"5548":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"自增主键"},"5549":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"推荐"},"5550":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/c