t","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"不推荐"},"5562":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-321","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"排序和比较规则不稳定"},"5563":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-322","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#增量更新","content":"增量配置步骤："},"5564":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-323","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#选择增量","content":"在“更新方式”中选择“增量”。系统会尝试识别可用的增量字段。"},"5565":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-324","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#确认增量字段","content":"展开“更多设置”，选择自增 ID、更新时间或其他可靠水位字段。不要仅因为字段排在第一个就直接使用。"},"5566":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-325","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置全量刷新间隔","content":"增量任务建议保留周期性全量校准，例如每 24 小时做一次全量刷新，用来修正遗漏、补录和水位异常。"},"5567":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-326","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置超时时间","content":"根据数据量设置合理超时。任务经常超时，通常说明数据范围太大、SQL 太慢或源库连接不稳定。"},"5568":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-327","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#开启更新后校验","content":"勾选“更新后校验”。任务完成后对比源端和缓存端的行数或水位，便于发现缓存异常。"},"5569":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-328","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#执行一次并查看状态","content":"点击“立即更新”，确认行数、执行时间、缓存状态和校验结果正常。"},"5570":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-329","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时更新用于把数据集刷新节奏固定下来。它不等同于“越频繁越好”，刷新频率要和源数据产生频率、业务使用时间和系统承载能力匹配。"},"5571":{"id":"/docs/cres