crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"如果接口返回嵌套 JSON，先和接口负责人确认需要分析的字段。不应把整段原始 JSON 直接作为一个字段交给业务用户。"},"5845":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-194","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"数据源保存后，进入表管理区域检查库表是否完整。列表中通常可以看到表名、类型、注释等信息。"},"5846":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-195","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表列表用于确认 Crest 能看到哪些表或视图。正式项目建议优先使用业务视图或数仓宽表，减少直接读取原始业务表。看到表名后不要立刻拿去做图表，先打开表预览检查字段和样例数据。"},"5847":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-196","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"打开目标表后，先检查字段，再做数据预览。"},"5848":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-197","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表预览用于做第一轮数据验收。预览阶段至少要检查字段类型、日期格式、金额单位、空值、乱码和样例行。如果源数据在预览阶段已经异常，后续数据集、图表和大屏都会受到影响。"},"5849":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-198","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"保存后至少检查这些内容："},"5850":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-199","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"目标表或视图是否能看到。"},"5851":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-200","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"字段名称、字段类型和注释是否完整。"},"5852":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-201","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"日期、金额、数量等关键字段是否识别正确。"},"5853":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dat