st/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"绑定数据时建议每做完一个组件就保存一次。大屏组件较多，等全部组件都完成后再保存，一旦浏览器刷新或网络异常，可能丢失较多配置。"},"6772":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-225","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"v1.5.5 起，数据大屏支持“导出按钮”组件。它适合在大屏上放一个明确的下载入口，让用户按当前筛选条件导出某个表格视图。"},"6773":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-226","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"导出按钮通常和明细表或汇总表配合使用："},"6774":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-227","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置项"},"6775":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-228","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"说明"},"6776":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-229","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"按钮文案"},"6777":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-230","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"展示在大屏上的按钮文字，例如“导出明细”“下载当前筛选结果”"},"6778":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-231","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"目标表格"},"6779":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-232","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"选择当前大屏中的明细表、汇总表或透视表组件"},"6780":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-233","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"导出范围"},"6781":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-234","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"可选择当前筛选结果或全部数据"},"6782":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-235","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表格式"},"6783":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-236","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表可按配置导出带格式 Excel"},"6784":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-237","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置步骤："},"6785":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-238","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先配置表格","content":"先把明细表或汇总表放到画布中，完成数据集、字段、排序、表头说明和权限检查。"},"6786":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-239","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加导出按钮","content":"在组件面板中添加导出按钮，将按钮放在表格附近或页面操作区。"},"6787":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-240","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定目标表格","content":"在按钮配置中选择要导出的表格组件。目标表格应是用户当前能看懂、能核对的数据。"},"6788":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-241","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#选择导出范围","content":"需要按页面查询组件、联动和外部参数导出时，选择当前筛选结果。需要导出完整数据时，确认权限和数据量后再选择全部数据。"},"6789":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-242","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"发布前进入预览页，设置筛选条件后点击导出按钮，确认导出中心生成任务，下载后核对字段、表头和数据范围。"},"6790":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-243","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"导出按钮不是简单截图下载。表格视图导出会结合当前筛选、联动、外部参数、Web 参数和钻取上下文生成 Excel。正式大屏中建议把导出按钮放在明细表附近，并用清晰文案说明导出范围。"},"6791":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-244","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#实战做出示例里的关键组件","content":"内置大屏里有几类组件适合复用：累积流图、阶段漏斗、投入产出矩阵、明细表、趋势图和时效排行。下面按“组件效果、示例字段、编辑器配置”说明。示例字段只用于演示配置思路，正式页面应替换为企业自己的需求、项目、人员、质量或经营字段。"},"6792":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-245","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"这张图用于看需求在不同阶段的堆积情况。面积越厚，说明该阶段积压越多；整体上升，说明需求池总量在增长；某个颜色持续变厚，通常代表该阶段成为瓶颈。"},"6793":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-246","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"演示示例配置："},"6794":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-247","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"配置项"},"6795":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-248","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6796":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-249","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"图表类型"},"6797":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-250","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"累积流图"},"6798":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"数据集"},"6799":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段每日快照类数据集"},"6800":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"X 轴"},"6801":{"id":"/docs/c