待发布。"},"6811":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"打开平滑曲线和面积填充，保留图例。颜色按阶段固定，避免每次刷新后变化。X 轴日期可以按天或周展示，标签过密时减少显示。"},"6812":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"6813":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"6814":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"6815":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"6816":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求数"},"6817":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"6818":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"6819":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"42"},"6820":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"6821":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","t