de/screen#需求流动明细表","content":"需求阶段、部门、项目、需求编码、优先级、需求类型、负责人、在库天数、需求工时、需求数"},"6928":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-381","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动明细表","content":"创建步骤："},"6929":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-382","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加明细表","content":"在图表组件中选择明细表。明细表适合放在大屏底部，宽度尽量铺满，方便横向展示字段。"},"6930":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-383","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#选择字段","content":"先放用户定位问题需要的字段：阶段、项目、需求编码、负责人、在库天数。初始配置不宜放入全部字段。"},"6931":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-384","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置排序-1","content":"风险类明细建议按在库天数、超期天数或优先级排序。普通明细可以按更新时间或需求编码排序。"},"6932":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-385","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整列宽","content":"需求编码、项目名称、负责人需要可读；数值列可以窄一些。列太多时，保留横向滚动条。"},"6933":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-386","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置表格样式","content":"表头使用浅底色，行高不要太小。大屏上表格主要用于定位，不适合展示过密文本。"},"6934":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-387","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置表格样式","content":"使用提醒：大屏表格不是 Excel。字段要少、列名要短、排序要明确，建议只展示需要现场处理的记录。"},"6935":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-388","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"趋势图用于看交付节奏。示例中用月份做 X 轴，同时展示进入需求数和交付需求数。"},"6936":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-389","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"配置方式："},"6937":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-390","page_i