48":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-401","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"如果要放到大屏主图区，趋势图建议只放 2 到 3 条线。线条过多时，观众难以远距离辨认。需要展示更多部门时，可以改成部门筛选或排行图。"},"6949":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-402","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"这张图用于比较各阶段平均耗时和 P90 耗时。P90 比平均值更能暴露长尾问题。"},"6950":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-403","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置方式："},"6951":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-404","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置项"},"6952":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-405","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"6953":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-406","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"图表类型"},"6954":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-407","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"横向条形图"},"6955":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-408","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"分类"},"6956":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-409","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"6957":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-410","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"指标"},"6958":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-411","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen"