ocs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员工作范围","content":"追踪关键操作，支撑安全审计"},"8023":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理顺序建议","content":"下面这条顺序适合新环境初始化，也适合接手权限边界不清的旧环境时重新梳理。"},"8024":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理顺序建议","content":"先按岗位设计角色，再把用户加入角色。不应为单个用户临时叠加权限，否则后续难以判断权限来源。"},"8025":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#建立组织和用户","content":"先在用户管理中维护组织，再创建实名用户。不要长期使用共享账号或临时账号承载正式资源。"},"8026":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#设计角色","content":"按岗位建立角色，例如平台管理员、数据管理员、分析开发者、业务查看者、外部访客。"},"8027":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#配置菜单和资源权限","content":"先给角色配置菜单，再给具体资源授权。资源权限不要默认全部开放。"},"8028":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#用普通账号验收","content":"创建一个普通测试账号，验证可见菜单、不可见菜单、导出和分享权限。"},"8029":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#接入-sso-和审计","content":"权限模型稳定后，再接入 SSO。接入后检查审计日志是否能记录登录、权限和资源操作。"},"8030":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"用户管理用于创建账号、维护组织、启停用户和调整角色。新用户入职、项目成员变更、离职回收权限，都从这里处理。"},"8031":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"角色管理用于把岗位职责整理成可复用权限集合。角色越清晰，后续权限审计越容易；角色越临时，越容易出现权限扩大。"},"8032":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员常用页面","content":"权限管理用于控制菜单、功能和资源访问。配置完成后必须用普通账号登录验证，不能只用管理员视角确认。"},"8033":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"频率"},"8034":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"检查项"},"8035":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每日"},"8036":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"异常登录、导出失败、关键资源变更"},"8037":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每周"},"8038":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"新增账号、离职账号、分享链接、默认密码使用情况"},"8039":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"每月"},"8040":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"角色权限、管理员账号、SSO 状态、审计日志"},"8041":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"项目结束"},"8042":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"回收临时账号、关闭临时分享、归档交付资源"},"8043":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#管理员日常检查","content":"检查时建议留下记录：检查日期、检查人、发现问题、处理动作和遗留风险。对外项目或生产环境，权限和分享链接巡检建议形成固定台账。"},"8044":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#后续章节","content":"创建账号、维护组织、处理账号启停和人员变更。"},"8045":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#后续章节","content":"设计角色、授权菜单、控制资源访问。"},"8046":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#后续章节","content":"管理系统参数、站点标识和可视化字体。"},"8047":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#后续章节","content":"对接企业身份系统并管理默认权限。"},"8048":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide#后续章节","content":"查看审计日志、修改密码、排查异常操作。"},"8049":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","type":"page","content":"角色与权限","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","管理员指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions"},"8050":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","content":"Crest 角色管理、权限管理、菜单权限和资源权限配置方法。"},"8051":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions#权限模型","content":"权限模型"},"8052":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions#角色设计原则","content":"角色设计原则"},"8053":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissions#常见角色示例","content":"常见角色示例"},"8054":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/roles-permissio